se port</label><input id="db-port" name="db_port" type="number" required min="1" max="65535" value="3306" inputmode="numeric"><p class="field-help">Usually 3306. Change it only if your host tells you to.</p></div><div class="field"><label for="db-database">Database name</label><input id="db-database" name="db_database" type="text" required maxlength="255" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Your full database name"><p class="field-help">Include the account prefix if your panel adds one.</p></div><div class="field"><label for="db-username">Database username</label><input id="db-username" name="db_username" type="text" required maxlength="255" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Your full database username"><p class="field-help">This is the database user, not your panel login.</p></div><div class="field field-wide"><label for="db-password">Database password</label><div class="password-wrap"><input id="db-password" name="db_password" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password" aria-describedby="db-password-help"><button type="button" class="password-toggle" id="toggle-password" aria-controls="db-password" aria-pressed="false">Show</button></div><p class="field-help" id="db-password-help">Paste the password you created for this database user. It is never shown in the review.</p></div></div></fieldset><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-back="2">← Back</button><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">Review details <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></form>
